      },
      "message": "fix(sim): re-judge kept parts live when the sim verdict is clean\n\nReview of PR #2312: a part added after generation that a stock-source\nchamfer cuts by 0.02 to 0.1 mm still posted. The sim lattice does not\nsee a cut that shallow, so the verdict is clean, and kept_moved ran\nonly in the not-judged arm. The clean arm now runs kept_moved too,\nonce every op is covered. Pinned on aligned and quarter-turned stock\nwith a 0.05 mm cut.\n\nThe decision now records this change and corrects the Deburr text:\na Deburr can take the stock as source; that gouge is #2313.\n\nFixes #2308\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
